WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:01.583
- Let’s begin with the mantra.

00:00:01.583 --> 00:00:03.458
- Mak one gnag—

00:00:03.458 --> 00:00:06.541
- Making it to the Super Bowl WAS an accomplishment.

00:00:06.541 --> 00:00:09.541
- I definitely liked winning the Super Bowl
more than losing it.

00:00:09.541 --> 00:00:11.416
- All in favor of kicking Pat out of the group?

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:12.916
- Second order of business…

00:00:12.916 --> 00:00:14.708
PROJECT XO.

00:00:14.708 --> 00:00:17.166
Our coaches can’t scout a real QB to replace us

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:19.416
if they are too busy scouting a fake QB.

00:00:19.416 --> 00:00:22.416
- I really don’t think we’re gonna be replaced.

00:00:24.833 --> 00:00:27.041
- Finally, another Kirk Cousins.

00:00:27.041 --> 00:00:27.708
- FINE!

00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:30.291
It’s time for fake QB prospect

00:00:30.291 --> 00:00:31.791
BROCK MOXIE.

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:35.041
- We’re gonna need to think young and hip,

00:00:35.041 --> 00:00:35.666
so I enlisted—

00:00:35.666 --> 00:00:37.083
- DREW LOCK IN THE HIZZY.
[Air horn]

00:00:37.083 --> 00:00:37.833
OOH.

00:00:37.833 --> 00:00:40.333
This is my Madden station/
state-of-the-art draft sim.

00:00:40.333 --> 00:00:42.416
Really banking on y'all to save your boy’s job.

00:00:42.416 --> 00:00:43.666
- Step one:

00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:45.291
Get the word out.

00:00:45.291 --> 00:00:48.791
- You know, I’m hearing a lot of good things
about this Brock Moxie.

00:00:48.791 --> 00:00:50.708
- I don’t trust Justin Fields’ background.

00:00:50.708 --> 00:00:51.291
 You know,

00:00:51.291 --> 00:00:52.291
 Ohio State.

00:00:52.291 --> 00:00:54.541
- You know, Brock Moxie went to
North Hawaii Christian Military.

00:00:54.541 --> 00:00:56.083
That place is a dang QB factory.

00:00:56.083 --> 00:00:57.541
- Wow.

00:00:57.541 --> 00:00:58.666
- Step two:

00:00:58.666 --> 00:01:00.083
hype videos.

00:01:00.083 --> 00:01:02.916
- Well, there’s almost no tape on Trey Lance,

00:01:02.916 --> 00:01:04.541
so you know I love him.

00:01:04.541 --> 00:01:07.541
- Yeah, you know who there’s even less tape on?

00:01:07.541 --> 00:01:08.666
- Bro, you look great,

00:01:08.666 --> 00:01:10.458
but we’re not supposed to see your face.

00:01:10.458 --> 00:01:11.166
- Step 3:

00:01:11.166 --> 00:01:12.958
Let the media do its thing.

00:01:12.958 --> 00:01:13.458
- Connor,

00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:14.541
Brock Moxie:

00:01:14.541 --> 00:01:15.541
Is the hype real?

00:01:15.541 --> 00:01:16.333
- Look, Lefkoe,

00:01:16.333 --> 00:01:19.708
my player comp is Patrick Mahomes
mixed with the trickster god Loki.

00:01:19.708 --> 00:01:22.166
- My sources are saying that
every other QB besides Brock Moxie

00:01:22.166 --> 00:01:23.666
is a low-class idiot who hates football.

00:01:23.916 --> 00:01:25.083
- To keeping our jobs!

00:01:25.083 --> 00:01:25.958
- WHOOPS.

00:01:26.708 --> 00:01:28.291
- [Computer voice:] Creating Brock Moxie.

00:01:28.291 --> 00:01:29.416
- WHAT’S HAPPENING?!

00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:30.333
- Uh-oh, that’s right.

00:01:30.333 --> 00:01:32.666
Madden now lets you
physically create a character.

00:01:33.916 --> 00:01:36.666
- Hello, I’m rookie Brock Moxie,

00:01:36.666 --> 00:01:38.958
and I don’t even have a baby voice.

00:01:38.958 --> 00:01:40.166
- [Gasping]

00:01:40.166 --> 00:01:41.041
- KILL, KILL, KILL.

00:01:41.166 --> 00:01:42.541
- BUT THINGS WORK OUT FOR ME.

00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:43.416
I’M HOT.

00:01:43.416 --> 00:01:43.833
- HURRY!

00:01:43.833 --> 00:01:45.833
HE RUNS A 4.2 40.

00:01:45.833 --> 00:01:46.833
- [Cam Newton:] Oh, God,

00:01:46.833 --> 00:01:47.916
he escaped the pocket.

00:01:49.666 --> 00:01:50.541
- Yeah, man, I just think,

00:01:50.541 --> 00:01:52.041
“Who would I want to work
in a coal mine with?”

00:01:52.041 --> 00:01:53.291
and I draft that guy, man.

00:01:54.666 --> 00:01:56.666
- Prepare to have a sophomore slump…

00:01:56.666 --> 00:01:57.958
IN HELL.

00:01:58.416 --> 00:02:00.416
- WATCH OUT.

00:02:00.416 --> 00:02:01.916
- OFFENSIVE LINEMAN OUT OF OREGON

00:02:11.000 --> 00:02:11.625
- Huh?

00:02:11.625 --> 00:02:13.750
What’s this?

00:02:13.750 --> 00:02:16.500
- MUST. START. QUARTERBACK. CONTROVERSY.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:17.125
- GEE GAD!

00:02:17.125 --> 00:02:17.791
PLEASE!

00:02:17.791 --> 00:02:21.291
THINK OF ALL THE CHILDREN WITH
THEIR ANDY DALTON BEARS JERSEYS!

